# Rule enforcement — the mechanical gate layer

Text rules demonstrably do not bind on their own — repeated sessions agreed
with them and didn't execute them. This file documents the mechanical
layer that closes the gap: `.devin/hooks.v1.json` +
`.devin/scripts/session-tracker.mjs` (PostToolUse, records which triggers
fired per session) + `.devin/scripts/stop-gate.mjs` (Stop, refuses to end
the turn while an armed obligation is unmet).

## Gate map — what arms each check and what satisfies it

| Check | Armed by | Satisfied by | Exemption marker |
|---|---|---|---|
